# ArchiveXL: register the port's own prop factory.
#
# WITHOUT THIS FILE THE ITEM ROUTE IS SILENTLY DEAD. An item whose `entityName` is a factory name --
# Items.VRPortLoadOverture (the Overture's speedloader) and Items.VRPortHlTest -- resolves that name
# through a factory csv, and a name that resolves to nothing does not fail loudly: the game's
# `AddItemToSlot` returns TRUE and leaves the slot empty. Measured 2026-09-02: both items reported a
# successful attach and `GetItemInSlot` came back null, and the only .xl beside the archive was
# VRCigarette's, which registers the smoking wheel's csv and nothing else.
#
# The csv itself must stay a COOKED C2dArray (that is how mods\archive\build\base\vrport\vrp_props.csv
# is built): ArchiveXL reads a text csv as zero rows, logs "Loading factory", and the name again
# resolves to nothing.
#
# This file belongs next to cyberpunkvrport.archive in archive\pc\mod\.
factories:
  - base\vrport\vrp_props.csv
